      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7609505",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760950501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760950501": {
            "id": "760950501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Are you feeling rested? Have you talked to everyone you wanted to?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950503",
              "760950505"
            ]
          },
          "760950503": {
            "id": "760950503",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Alright. Take your time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950506"
            ]
          },
          "760950506": {
            "id": "760950506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Zeitlind, calm down for a moment and hear me out. I have no wish to be disrespectful, or to speak out of blind hope.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950507"
            ]
          },
          "760950507": {
            "id": "760950507",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Your sister may still be alive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950508"
            ]
          },
          "760950508": {
            "id": "760950508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "I saw her gravestone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950509"
            ]
          },
          "760950509": {
            "id": "760950509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Her picture was right there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950510"
            ]
          },
          "760950510": {
            "id": "760950510",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "But... isn't it possible there's nothing buried within?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950511"
            ]
          },
          "760950511": {
            "id": "760950511",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon wants that to be true, really. But isn't that kind of optimistic?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950512"
            ]
          },
          "760950512": {
            "id": "760950512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "In the last letter she wrote me, my sister said she'd already decided to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950513"
            ]
          },
          "760950513": {
            "id": "760950513",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "That farewell wasn't written as a final goodbye, was it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950514"
            ]
          },
          "760950514": {
            "id": "760950514",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "She said she was going somewhere far away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950515"
            ]
          },
          "760950515": {
            "id": "760950515",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "She mentioned it to me before. She always wanted to travel the world before she got old.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950516"
            ]
          },
          "760950516": {
            "id": "760950516",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Hilda wasn't speaking figuratively. She really did leave the sanatorium and set off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950517"
            ]
          },
          "760950517": {
            "id": "760950517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "She talked about that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950518"
            ]
          },
          "760950518": {
            "id": "760950518",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "She was always so bright. She got along with people easily.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950519"
            ]
          },
          "760950519": {
            "id": "760950519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Then she probably never told you... that we were all that the other had.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950520"
            ]
          },
          "760950520": {
            "id": "760950520",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950521"
            ]
          },
          "760950521": {
            "id": "760950521",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Let me be honest. Let me be cold for a moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950522"
            ]
          },
          "760950522": {
            "id": "760950522",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "If her leaving would've caused three or four people to grieve, that weight might've outweighed her sadness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950523"
            ]
          },
          "760950523": {
            "id": "760950523",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "But now it's only me. She knew I'd understand. That I would forgive her for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950524"
            ]
          },
          "760950524": {
            "id": "760950524",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "It's not like that. You shouldn't think of it that way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950525"
            ]
          },
          "760950525": {
            "id": "760950525",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "You don't have to feel sorry for me. When we were kids, our parents were still around, and life was good. Those memories were enough to carry us forward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950526"
            ]
          },
          "760950526": {
            "id": "760950526",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "But growing up... The world gets hard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950527"
            ]
          },
          "760950527": {
            "id": "760950527",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "I've always been more introverted, and dealing with people at work really wears me out. I thought my sister, being so outgoing, would have it easier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950528"
            ]
          },
          "760950528": {
            "id": "760950528",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "But even she always looked exhausted once she grew up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950529"
            ]
          },
          "760950529": {
            "id": "760950529",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950530"
            ]
          },
          "760950530": {
            "id": "760950530",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "You two still have a future.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950531"
            ]
          },
          "760950531": {
            "id": "760950531",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Oh. Then she probably never mentioned her fiance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950532"
            ]
          },
          "760950532": {
            "id": "760950532",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "He was just a good person. An ordinary one. Kind. Interesting. Sometimes I wish he hadn't been. If he'd been a bad man, things might've been easier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950533"
            ]
          },
          "760950533": {
            "id": "760950533",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "His family had a hereditary illness. Some strange disease — they never lived long.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950534"
            ]
          },
          "760950534": {
            "id": "760950534",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "He'd joke about it sometimes, blame the Anemo Archon for planning Mondstadt too well, so even a family like his never faded out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950535"
            ]
          },
          "760950535": {
            "id": "760950535",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "One day, he said he was going to save the world, and then he left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950536"
            ]
          },
          "760950536": {
            "id": "760950536",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Save the world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950537"
            ]
          },
          "760950537": {
            "id": "760950537",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Well, the world's still turning. So maybe, somewhere out there, in a place no one noticed, he really did.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950538"
            ]
          },
          "760950538": {
            "id": "760950538",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "You know how you always say that if someone who lives forever can't love everyone and be loved back, the world would drown in sorrow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950539"
            ]
          },
          "760950539": {
            "id": "760950539",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "I think you're right. Which means a short life isn't even allowed that much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950540"
            ]
          },
          "760950540": {
            "id": "760950540",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "He wanted to give his life to love. And it only hurt my sister more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950541"
            ]
          },
          "760950541": {
            "id": "760950541",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "So much that she was sent to a sanatorium in the mountains — this very place beneath our feet. A place steeped in curses.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950542"
            ]
          },
          "760950542": {
            "id": "760950542",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "She never told me any of this. I'm sorry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950543"
            ]
          },
          "760950543": {
            "id": "760950543",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "And knowing all that, you still think she's alive?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950544"
            ]
          },
          "760950544": {
            "id": "760950544",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "I do. Because she did something here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950545"
            ]
          },
          "760950545": {
            "id": "760950545",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "And because of my fear, she was forced to live on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950546"
            ]
          },
          "760950546": {
            "id": "760950546",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "You have my respect, Istoria, you really do. But I think you've seen too much suffering across history.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950547"
            ]
          },
          "760950547": {
            "id": "760950547",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Pain vast enough to drown the world... For someone as ordinary as me, even a small part of that is enough to bury an entire life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950548"
            ]
          },
          "760950548": {
            "id": "760950548",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "You can't truly understand my sister and I.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950549"
            ]
          },
          "760950549": {
            "id": "760950549",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "So, how do I set foot on mortal earth once more? I'm just a short-lived little someone. Eternity isn't meant for me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950550"
            ]
          },
          "760950550": {
            "id": "760950550",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "*sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950551"
            ]
          },
          "760950551": {
            "id": "760950551",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Mr. Istoria?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950552"
            ]
          },
          "760950552": {
            "id": "760950552",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "This place used to be completely cut off from the world above. There was no way in and no way out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950553"
            ]
          },
          "760950553": {
            "id": "760950553",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "But after Nihilita fell, Dex seems to have gained the ability to carry people of the living world between the Pillar Hall and the surface.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950554"
            ]
          },
          "760950554": {
            "id": "760950554",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Even so, it cannot return those who were chosen to come here. It is a Watcher in juvenile form, and that limitation is part of its nature.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950555"
            ]
          },
          "760950555": {
            "id": "760950555",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? You're saying Dex is the same kind of being as Nihilita?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950556"
            ]
          },
          "760950556": {
            "id": "760950556",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Dex",
            "text": "♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950557"
            ]
          },
          "760950557": {
            "id": "760950557",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "If we want to go back down, there's only one way. We have to give up every memory we have, everything we know, and climb to the very top. In the past, that meant meeting the mistress. Now, it would be Melanta.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760950558"
            ]
          },
          "760950558": {
            "id": "760950558",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "So I can't go with you. But at least, let me see you off."
          },
          "760950505": {
            "id": "760950505",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Istoria",
            "text": "Very well."
          }
        }
      }
